# Vercel builds website/ (project rootDirectory), but the Astro build reads a
# few sibling paths from the repo root: examples/*.li and stdlib/*.li (embedded
# snippets resolved by Code.astro) and editors/vscode-lira/syntaxes/lira.tmLanguage.json
# (the Shiki highlighting grammar loaded by astro.config.mjs).
#
# Everything else (crates/, docs/, lira-playground/, the rest of editors/,
# target/) is irrelevant to the site and — editors/ alone is ~15MB — pushes the
# CLI upload past Vercel's 10MB limit. Allowlist only what the build needs.
/*
!/website
!/examples
!/stdlib
!/editors
/editors/*
!/editors/vscode-lira
/editors/vscode-lira/*
!/editors/vscode-lira/syntaxes
